    "summary": "Pouch or bag made of silk; two rectangles of silk printed with turquoise, white, green, black, yellow and red ikat-style design, sewn down sides and across bottom; lined with red cotton printed with multicoloured flowers; band of black and yellow diamonds on fuchsia background around open end; string of white glass beads sewn on around top of back to make loops, through which is threaded green braided cord for drawstring, ends of cord two tassels of blue, red and yellow stripes of glass beads each splitting into three tassels of blue and white stripes of beads; tassels around sides and bottom of blue acrylic yarn with white beads at top, split into strands each with white bead, alternating fuchsia or yellow thread wrapped around strands.",
